{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中國移動上半年少賺百分之6.2，純利有789億元人民幣。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"> 中期息則微升，至每股2.51元人民幣。期內收入5,380億元人民幣，按年上升一成。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T10:20:20.514112+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":70,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}